title Structural Design Patterns Overview

* **Structural\nDesign Patterns**
** Interface Patterns
*** **Adapter**\nConverts incompatible interfaces
*** **Facade**\nSimplifies subsystem interfaces
** Composition Patterns
*** **Composite**\nComposes objects into trees
*** **Decorator**\nAdds responsibilities dynamically
** Separation Patterns
*** **Bridge**\nSeparates abstraction from implementation
** Optimization Patterns
*** **Flyweight**\nShares state to save memory
** Access Control Patterns
*** **Proxy**\nControls access to another object

@endmindmap
